# Local cargo configuration. The wrappers own the scratch rules, and a
# machine-specific target directory override must not travel with the checkout.
/.cargo/

# Runtime state a test binary creates next to the crate when it resolves
# DATA_DIR from its own working directory: this is the same `data/`
# (`gallery.db`, `db-backups`, `retained-dirs`) the root rule keeps out, one
# level down, and `data/` is anchored at the repository root.
/rust/gallery_accel/data/
